{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Operations dashboard for the nopCommerce Search → View Product flow. Monitors search index health, pricing cache performance, error rates, and distributed traces.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 50,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# nopCommerce — Operations Dashboard\n\nMonitors the health of the **Search → View Product** flow — instrumented with custom metrics and distributed tracing.\n\n| Signal | What it detects | Where to look |\n|--------|----------------|---------------|\n| **No-Results Ratio spike** | Catalog/index/DB degradation hidden behind HTTP 200s | Search Pipeline Health |\n| **Pricing Cache Miss spike** | Cache flush, TTL misconfiguration, or memory eviction — leading indicator for latency increase | Pricing Cache Health |\n| **5xx on flow endpoints** | Flow-specific vs site-wide outage | Flow Error Rate |\n| **Trace drill-down** | Pinpoint slow span in a degraded request | Distributed Traces |"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "System Health Overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Request Rate",
      "description": "Total HTTP throughput by method. A sudden drop means the app is unreachable or crashing. POST traffic corresponds to form submissions (search, add-to-cart).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Total",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[1m])) by (http_request_method)",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_request_method}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Request Latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "Response time percentiles. p99 spike with flat p50 = a subset of requests is slow (likely DB queries or cache misses). Sustained p95 increase = systemic degradation.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5xx Error Rate",
      "description": "Server error rate across all endpoints. First thing to check during an incident. Non-zero sustained = something is throwing exceptions.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 30, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Search Pipeline Health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Search Throughput",
      "description": "Rate of non-empty search queries hitting CatalogController.Search() and SearchProducts(). Establishes the baseline. A drop means broken search page, deployment issue, or upstream traffic loss.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "opm"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(search_performed_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Searches/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "No-Results Ratio",
      "description": "KEY OPERATIONAL SIGNAL. Ratio of searches returning zero products. Baseline ~10-15%. A spike to 50%+ means catalog data is missing, search index is corrupted, or DB connection is degraded — even though the app still returns HTTP 200. Detects silent failures.",
      "type": "gauge",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 60 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(search_no_results_total / search_performed_total) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "No-results %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Search vs No-Results Over Time",
      "description": "Overlay of total search rate and no-results rate. Use this to correlate when degradation started — if both lines rise together, it's a traffic spike hitting missing catalog data. If no-results rises while searches stay flat, something broke in the backend.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "opm"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "No results/min" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Searches/min" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(search_performed_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Searches/min",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(search_no_results_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "No results/min",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pricing Cache Health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Pricing Cache Miss Rate",
      "description": "LEADING INDICATOR. Rate of cache misses in GetFinalPrice — the pricing pipeline that runs on every search result and product detail page. A spike means: cache was flushed (deployment), TTL misconfigured, memory pressure evicting entries, or new products flooding in (catalog import). Expect latency to increase shortly after a sustained spike.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "opm"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(pricing_cache_miss_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Cache misses/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cache Misses vs Search Volume",
      "description": "Overlay of cache misses and search throughput. If both rise together, it's normal — more searches means more pricing calls. If cache misses spike while search volume is flat, the cache is degraded (flush, eviction, TTL issue).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "opm"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Cache misses/min" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Searches/min" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(pricing_cache_miss_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Cache misses/min",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(search_performed_total[5m]) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "Searches/min",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Flow Error Rate",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "5xx — Flow Endpoints vs Total",
      "description": "Compares 5xx rate on search/product routes against total 5xx. If flow errors spike but total stays flat, the issue is isolated to the instrumented pipeline. If both spike, it's a site-wide outage (DB down, infrastructure issue).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 25, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Flow 5xx/s" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Total 5xx/s" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\", http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Flow 5xx/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Total 5xx/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Flow Error Percentage",
      "description": "Percentage of requests to search/product endpoints returning 5xx. Green <1%, yellow 1-5%, red >5%. A non-zero value here warrants investigation — check the traces section below to find the failing span.",
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\", http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=~\".*(search|product).*\"}[5m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Flow error %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Distributed Traces",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "id": 104,
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "Recent Traces — Search",
      "description": "Traces for text search (search box submit, AJAX pagination, autocomplete).",
      "type": "table",
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 42 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.Search",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.SearchProducts",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.SearchAutoComplete",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Recent Traces — Category & Manufacturer",
      "description": "Traces for browsing by category and manufacturer.",
      "type": "table",
      "id": 20,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 42 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.Category",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.Manufacturer",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Recent Traces — Product Details",
      "description": "Traces for viewing a product page.",
      "type": "table",
      "id": 21,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.ProductDetails",
          "limit": 10,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Recent Traces — Tags, New Products, Vendors & Filters",
      "description": "Traces for product tags, new products page, vendor browsing, and filter level search.",
      "type": "table",
      "id": 22,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.ProductsByTag",
          "limit": 5,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.NewProducts",
          "limit": 5,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.Vendor",
          "limit": 5,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "nopCommerce",
          "operation": "Catalog.SearchByFilterLevelValues",
          "limit": 5,
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Runtime Health",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 52 },
      "id": 105,
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "title": "GC Heap Size",
          "description": "Memory used by the .NET GC. A steadily growing heap without plateaus indicates a memory leak. Correlate with deployment times.",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 12,
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 53 },
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
              "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
              "unit": "bytes"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "process_runtime_dotnet_gc_heap_size_bytes",
              "legendFormat": "Heap size",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "GC Collections",
          "description": "GC collection rate by generation. Frequent Gen2 collections = memory pressure, possible large object allocation issues.",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 13,
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 53 },
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
              "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "rate(process_runtime_dotnet_gc_collections_count_total[5m])",
              "legendFormat": "Gen {{generation}}",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Thread Pool",
          "description": "Active threads and work item queue. Growing queue with stable thread count = pool saturation, requests are waiting. May correlate with latency spikes.",
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 14,
          "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 53 },
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
              "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "spanNulls": false },
              "unit": "short"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "process_runtime_dotnet_thread_pool_threads_count",
              "legendFormat": "Active threads",
              "refId": "A"
            },
            {
              "expr": "rate(process_runtime_dotnet_thread_pool_queue_length[5m])",
              "legendFormat": "Queue length rate",
              "refId": "B"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["nopcommerce", "operations"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
